## Article 289-1. Financial monitoring cases

```catala
declaration scope Article2891FinancialMonitoring:
  input check content FinancialMonitoringCheck
  output challengeAllowed content YesNo
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output generalProceedingRequired content YesNo

scope Article2891FinancialMonitoring:
# Financial monitoring decisions can be challenged
  label challenge definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.monitoringDecisionChallenged = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition challengeAllowed equals No

# Filing within 10 days
  label timely definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinTenDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinTenDays = No
    consequence equals No

# General proceeding required
  label general definition generalProceedingRequired equals Yes
```

## Article 289-2. Travel restriction cases

```catala
declaration scope Article2892TravelRestriction:
  input check content TravelRestrictionCheck
  output challengeAllowed content YesNo
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo

scope Article2892TravelRestriction:
# Travel restrictions can be challenged
  label challenge definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.travelRestrictionChallenged = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition challengeAllowed equals No

# Filing within 10 days
  label timely definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinTenDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinTenDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Appeal within 5 days
  label timely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinFiveDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinFiveDays = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 289-3. Political party prohibition cases

```catala
declaration scope Article2893PartyProhibition:
  input check content PartyProhibitionCheck
  output challengeAllowed content YesNo
  output supremeCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo
  output generalProceedingRequired content YesNo

scope Article2893PartyProhibition:
# Political party prohibition can be challenged
  label challenge definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.prohibitionGroundExists = Yes
    and check.filedByAuthorizedBody = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition challengeAllowed equals No

# Supreme Court has jurisdiction
  label supreme definition supremeCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    check.supremeCourtJurisdiction = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_supreme definition supremeCourtHasJurisdiction equals No

# General proceeding required
  label general definition generalProceedingRequired equals Yes
```

